{"id":"conferencia","lemma":"conferencia","pos":"noun","rank":1854,"glosses":["conference","meeting","lecture"],"ipa":"/konfeˈɾenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conferencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-conferencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo asistiré a la conferencia.","en":"I will go to the meeting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706608"},{"text":"Sus conferencias son muy largas.","en":"His lectures are very long."},{"text":"¿Tendré que dar una conferencia?","en":"Will I have to give a lecture?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702945"},{"text":"Él asiste a conferencias médicas.","en":"He attends medical conferences."},{"text":"¿Ha finalizado ya la conferencia?","en":"Is the lecture already finished?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803863"}]}